request.description:
Get field visibility config for a specific module.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "plant_code": "0001",
    "shed_id": 1,
    "module": "mortality",
    "part_enabled": true,
    "line_enabled": false,
    "fields": {
      "part_row": { "visible": true, "required": true },
      "line": { "visible": false, "required": false }
    }
  }
}
```

Get config for ALL modules (omit module param).

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "plant_code": "0001",
    "shed_id": 1,
    "modules": {
      "feed": { "part_enabled": true, "line_enabled": true, "fields": {...} },
      "water": { "part_enabled": true, "line_enabled": false, "fields": {...} },
      "medicine": { ... },
      "mortality": { ... }
    }
  }
}
```
